<title>USA: Equisure sets 1 for 20 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Equisure sets 1 for 20 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equisure Inc said Friday it set a one for 20 stock dividend for its shareholders.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid on May 30 to shareholders of record on May 15.</p>
<p>Equisure, through its wholly owned subsidiary, Equihot Herverzekering NV, is a reinsurance company engaged primarily in covering financial and political reinsurance risks.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
